===
true Tritonic, making the Tritone 590·22 cents, necessarily differs very slightly from equal temperament, which makes it 600 cents, while the false Tritonic, making the Tritone 568·716, or a comma too flat, approaches very near to Zarlino's and the Meantone, so that I @@R1@@
